("madonna-and-child-enthroned-with-saints-john-the-baptis",7,0,"Mary and the baby Jesus sit on a high throne between Saint John the Baptist and Saint Sebastian. Pietro Perugino painted it in 1493, and you can almost feel the calm."),
("portrait-of-the-artist-holding-a-thistle",1,0,"A young man in a red cap holds a thistle, a spiky flower, in his hand and looks right at you. Albrecht Dürer painted this self-portrait in 1493 when he was 22, and he may have sent it to his bride-to-be."),
("the-hermit-saint",7,0,"A hermit saint sits reading in a rocky place, surrounded by strange creatures. This is a panel from a triptych by Hieronymus Bosch, painted in about 1493."),
